{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"ALSA-2026:57462","published":"2026-08-20T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-08-21T15:15:03.182141703Z","related":["CVE-2026-8286"],"summary":"Important: curl security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":"The curl packages provide the libcurl library and the curl utility for downloading files from servers using various protocols, including HTTP, FTP, and LDAP.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * curl: curl: Insecure connection establishment due to TLS configuration mismatch (CVE-2026-8286)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * Regression of AlmaLinux-73788. The .9 revision appears to have broken the logic that forces NTLM to use HTTP/1.1. (JIRA:AlmaLinux-171912)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"curl","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/curl"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.61.1-34.el8_10.13"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:57462.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libcurl","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/libcurl"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.61.1-34.el8_10.13"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:57462.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libcurl-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/libcurl-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.61.1-34.el8_10.13"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:57462.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libcurl-minimal","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/libcurl-minimal"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.61.1-34.el8_10.13"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:57462.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:57462"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-8286"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/2496763"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://errata.almalinux.org/8/ALSA-2026-57462.html"}]}